# Think before code

Consequential work: **`briefing-and-planning`** (hand-off) and **`think-before-ship`** (design note, size skip/medium/large) before code. Formal methods: **`formal-verification-starter`** only if its checklist passes (unusual here).

Install pointer: [docs/THINKING_SKILLS_INSTALL.md](../../docs/THINKING_SKILLS_INSTALL.md).

Skills (not long rules):

| Need | Skill |
|------|--------|
| Design note, adversarial pass, statechart | `think-before-ship` |
| Product, brand, copy SSOT | `product-architecture-context` |
| Cloud/subagent brief, plan-then-build | `briefing-and-planning` |
| TLA+ / Lean when warranted | `formal-verification-starter` |

Existing phase workflow (`planning.mdc`, `execution.mdc`, `quality-gates.mdc`) still applies. These skills add sizing, briefs, and design notes; they do not replace approval gates.